 ## [Unreleased]
+### Added
+
+- Added the `sql_file_exts` config value to allow the user to configure
+  which file extensions are treated as sql files when linting. This
+  allows for example linting of jinja templated sql files with a
+  `.sql.j2` extension.
 ### Changed
 
 ## [0.4.1] - 2021-02-25
diff --git a/docs/source/configuration.rst b/docs/source/configuration.rst
